":[]},{"id":"164","parent":"161","text":"Desarreglo miofibrillas, perdida unidades motoras","guid":"RI-0i2MbR1afzwy1UKNKEg","children":[]},{"id":"165","parent":"161","text":"Disfuncion mitocondrial, dano oxidativo","guid":"3mW-GBJmQYeyL1Omyu62Yw","children":[]}]},{"id":"166","parent":"160","text":"Grasa NO es inerte","guid":"P-QxouX7S3mMJu9PcG1dSA","children":[{"id":"167","parent":"166","text":"Grasa intramuscular -> entorno inflamatorio","guid":"yJ2m6bcnTOi-hyil3AtcIA","children":[]},{"id":"168","parent":"166","text":"Grasa visceral produce adipokinas (leptina, adiponectina) + TNF-a, IL-6","guid":"UFFL7RNZRKWQhtN3vOiQvA","children":[]},{"id":"169","parent":"166","text":"Grasa medular osea activa metabolicamente","guid":"1ZEtfNCuToCZUjDU67DRLg","children":[]}]},{"id":"170","parent":"160","text":"Joven vs mayor con igual circunferencia abdominal","guid":"bkI0YZyrQUC-qMeQCM6xmw","children":[{"id":"171","parent":"170","text":"Joven predominio SUBCUTANEO","guid":"3Gj9UyPLRl6fhBXARuUUjw","children":[]},{"id":"172","parent":"170","text":"Mayor predominio VISCERAL (proinflamatorio)","guid":"SeHaUsjYSpCylJs3IKlX7A","children":[]}]},{"id":"173","parent":"160","text":"Sarcopenia","guid":"z4ExXUWJQ5SDfR-weLi6Lw","children":[{"id":"174","parent":"173","text":"Perdida masa + fuerza + potencia","guid":"LmnpSllpS_W551z11FNAJA","children":[]},{"id":"175","parent":"173","text":"POTENCIA muscular = fuerza x velocidad (predictor mas sensible)","guid":"SASye5J4SEShFRgEcll-xA","children":[]}]},{"id":"176","parent":"160","text":"Osteosarcopenia (concepto integrador)","guid":"gGjHf_HhRC6H_fsWSwi4zA","children":[{"id":"177","parent":"176","text":"Osteoporosis + sarcopenia coexisten biologicamente","guid":"cTuTJE6aQ8-lssLdjI5dGQ","children":[]},{"id":"178","parent":"176","text":"Comunicacion bidireccional via mioquinas/osteoquinas","guid":"0ZbvXDZ2QSC4SHEa76Ap9Q","children":[]},{"id":"179","parent":"176","text":"Mayor riesgo fractura que cada entidad por separado","guid":"nz3CKgZbTzeIWcEX-SZJTA","children":[]}]},{"id":"180","parent":"160","text":"Estudio Alexandros (INTA, Albala) mayor 80 anos","guid":"q98iOG5iQ_O5tj5jU_wEhQ","children":[{"id":"181","parent":"180","text":"Osteoporosis ~33% (1 de cada 3)","guid":"Zr8zlm__T-OvpmU3ijGCgw","children":[]},{"id":"182","parent":"180","text":"Sarcopenia 35-38% (1 de cada 3)","guid":"wIZZiRfJTey5qQf9Q5SxvA","children":[]},{"id":"183","parent":"180","text":"Fracturas mayor en osteosarcopenicos","guid":"9u9Kqgj2RVqscT0oXFH39g","children":[]}]},{"id":"184","parent":"160","text":"Implicancias clinicas","guid":"z4xv9YotTduZZdsD04183g","children":[{"id":"185","parent":"184","text":"Caidas -> fracturas -> hospitalizacion -> perdida funcional -> mortalidad","guid":"qVCvFqPST2q0vkjmcMkgpg","children":[]},{"id":"186","parent":"184","text":"Sarcopenia predictor independiente","guid":"d-kN8_MlS7qRgZgzrgI7OA","children":[]},{"id":"187","parent":"184","text":"Asociada a sindrome de fragilidad","guid":"zZg8yWoHQD6dA7wGoQZG8A","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"188","parent":"0","text":"Metabolismo de la glucosa","guid":"bO8HNBGSRt6RsKAK-escqw","children":[{"id":"189","parent":"188","text":"Hasta 25% AM tiene DM2","guid":"MQKTZDKHQNm_kpplLzF8_g","children":[]},{"id":"190","parent":"188","text":"Mecanismos","guid":"km8clTRUQ1aSs9yS4gjGdg","children":[{"id":"191","parent":"190","text":"Sarcopenia -> menor masa muscular -> menor disposicion glucosa","guid":"GHLOZ_hLTl-_uj2awjyQTg","children":[]},{"id":"192","parent":"190","text":"Grasa visceral -> adipokinas -> resistencia insulinica","guid":"U___4141QMWf8HAIY68g-Q","children":[]},{"id":"193","parent":"190","text":"Senescencia celulas beta -> menor produccion insulina","guid":"-h7VMMbfQlOewihHUiZlPA","children":[]}]},{"id":"194","parent":"188","text":"Obesidad sarcopenica (mejor predictor sindrome metabolico)","guid":"XsMmElL2RXidRMXVxL9SQA","children":[]},{"id":"195","parent":"188","text":"Respuesta contrarreguladora a hipoglicemia disminuida","guid":"eyB295taTXKgYzb8ii8WKA","children":[]},{"id":"196","parent":"188","text":"Mayor riesgo HIPOGLICEMIA GRAVE (caidas, deterioro cognitivo)","guid":"Q2AANXGLRvuOeGzNrSPaVQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"197","parent":"0","text":"Sintesis integradora","guid":"gDqX6rlRQDWW4UpiqFP2kw","children":[{"id":"198","parent":"197","text":"Cardiovascular hipertrofia + fibrosis + rigidez -> HFpEF, FA, HTA sistolica","guid":"l0BUn-gzTTyttZHGF5AMoQ","children":[]},{"id":"199","parent":"197","text":"Renal perdida cortical + glomerulo-esclerosis -> hiponatremia, hiperkalemia","guid":"u7zVIeB4QFG5ZhEpOsPcdw","children":[]},{"id":"200","parent":"197","text":"Cerebral perdida volumen sin neuronas -> HSD, trampas radiologicas","guid":"13bN9IZiQBa9t9PfRBhJ-A","children":[]},{"id":"201","parent":"197","text":"Musculo-hueso-grasa sarcopenia + osteoporosis + grasa visceral -> caidas, fragilidad","guid":"rsxAwLfPTVqdh_HrSLseFA","children":[]},{"id":"202","parent":"197","text":"HILO COMUN menor capacidad homeostatica -> mayor fragilidad","guid":"VEWGPN3HSPuBDOax82cMdQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"203","parent":"0","text":"Perlas Clinicas","guid":"YRxnNwNeTaqI83J1VwZVrw","children":[{"id":"204","parent":"203","text":"Perla 1 Hallmarks of aging son intervenibles farmacologicamente (rapamicina via mTOR aprobada FDA)","guid":"CLD-DNKOTN2WASd6q0-_Bg","children":[]},{"id":"205","parent":"203","text":"Perla 2 Heterogeneidad del envejecer tiene origen biologico -> perfiles por organo (no solo edad cronologica)","guid":"65HXuWYvQb2nx0NFQKITlg","children":[]},{"id":"206","parent":"203","text":"Perla 3 Fenotipo cardiaco del envejecimiento es DIASTOLICO no sistolico -> FEVI conservada + intolerancia a frecuencias altas","guid":"x2Tb724wREWaKUFWwJcSog","children":[]},{"id":"207","parent":"203","text":"Perla 4 Reserva venosa disminuida explica deshidratacion inexplicable -> hidratacion profilactica en pre-OP","guid":"IvWjnqbNTDCipahjm1WLDQ","children":[]},{"id":"208","parent":"203","text":"Perla 5 Funcion renal SUFICIENTE no es diagnostico -> no agregar IRC, pero AJUSTAR farmacos siempre","guid":"Jbhnr_m-TYWfDcYbSsnDOw","children":[]},{"id":"209","parent":"203","text":"Perla 6 Cerebro mayor pierde volumen sin perder neuronas -> cuidado con HCNT radiologica sin triada Hakim-Adams","guid":"kKQOYcSISa-Xd78LVmIApg","children":[]},{"id":"210","parent":"203","text":"Perla 7 HSD en mayor mecanismo aceleracion/desaceleracion -> conducta expectante muchas veces valida","guid":"4q1dSv3LT1Gs9kObXtftkA","children":[]},{"id":"211","parent":"203","text":"Perla 8 Osteosarcopenia es UNA enfermedad no dos -> tratar ambos (vit D + Ca + ejercicio resistencia + proteinas)","guid":"MAtmVuMZQtG-G0uUzwY40g","children":[]},{"id":"212","parent":"203","text":"Perla 9 Memoria semantica se preserva, memoria episodica se afecta -> distinguir envejecimiento normal de Alzheimer","guid":"iRwzIw7iQNO3SIaPwxXKhQ","children":[]},{"id":"213","parent":"203","text":"Perla 10 Arritmias en AM TIENDEN A PROGRESAR (no benignas como en jovenes) -> requieren seguimiento","guid":"cyxIqtW6SuWTibj-X_xDmA","children":[]},{"id":"214","parent":"203","text":"Perla 11 Grasa visceral produce TNF-a + IL-6 + leptina -> distribucion importa mas que peso total","guid":"28zM0-a_TZKbiUvDDgC0Gg","children":[]}]},{"id":"215","parent":"0","text":"Evidencia complementaria (papers oficiales)","guid":"qXE4EAEmRneAy2FMHJK-Qg","children":[{"id":"216","parent":"215","text":"Salech, Jara y Michea (Rev Med Clin Condes 2012) cambios fisiologicos por sistema","guid":"rC-5apj2Q9iiOs4imIZfug","children":[{"id":"217","parent":"216","text":"Volumen renal cae ~10% por decada despues de 40 anos","guid":"ULj0002mRf-zRa15iFkBDw","children":[]},{"id":"218","parent":"216","text":"Peso renal 250-270 g (40-50 a) -> 180-200 g (70-90 a)","guid":"TVugYAQjQd6euSzTrJ5S7A","children":[]},{"id":"219","parent":"216","text":"Esclerosis glomerular alcanza ~30% en la 8a decada","guid":"o-vdy4BnTXyXeIiGbsaW3w","children":[]},{"id":"220","parent":"216","text":"ERC prevalencia 15-50% en mayor 70 anos","guid":"JMlYiSgDS_GkIbzu0Ura_g","children":[]},{"id":"221","parent":"216","text":"Renina plasmatica 40-60% menor; aldosterona 30-50% menor en AM","guid":"qwOf63RERy21ADkN-pHaog","children":[]},{"id":"222","parent":"216","text":"Capacidad concentrar orina cae ~20% en 6a decada (caida acuaporinas 2 y 3, UT-A1)","guid":"NJNVglQDS2K8AddEeoIm9g","children":[]},{"id":"223","parent":"216","text":"Tabla 1 destaca volumen expulsivo CONSERVADO con FEVI preservada","guid":"Xp-4HBFdTTSCD2g24sexbw","children":[]}]},{"id":"224","parent":"215","text":"Molnar y cols (GeroScience 2021;43:2761-2784) aging venous system","guid":"nQ2hMT1wTsuV0ufonowuMA","children":[{"id":"225","parent":"224","text":"Edad es factor de riesgo INDEPENDIENTE de enfermedad venosa","guid":"UI2Xyw8WRgCWU_37gXC5hA","children":[]},{"id":"226","parent":"224","text":"Endotelio venoso envejecido permeable -> deposito sub-endotelial inflamatorio","guid":"JdI1ycH_Sk-S8AQiVcWwuw","children":[]},{"id":"227","parent":"224","text":"SECRETOMA SASP venoso IL1-alfa, IL6, IL8, MCP-1, VEGF, TGFbeta, MMP-1/3/10, PAI-1","guid":"8yH5zhYLQXu5VkYTMVttkg","children":[]},{"id":"228","parent":"224","text":"Aumento apoptosis miocito liso venoso -> debilita pared","guid":"C9BFUAqVQB2JzFYs93T-5A","children":[]},{"id":"229","parent":"224","text":"Disminucion compliance venosa -> menor reserva movilizable","guid":"wMFp0fz8TPS9Hpc_VFjylg","children":[]},{"id":"230","parent":"224","text":"Vinculo emergente patologia venosa -> deterioro cognitivo vascular (VCI)","guid":"YCRiOBd-RpGXi2Al_1qsCQ","children":[]},{"id":"231","parent":"224","text":"Implicancia clinica varices, IVC y TVP NO son banales en AM","guid":"AcDwZ6uCRKyXCpA8OhXl0w","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"232","parent":"0","text":"Conceptos examinados (Evaluaciones SGGCh 2026)","guid":"JVZsMxNXSlCVSWdZkKDKwA","children":[{"id":"233","parent":"232","text":"Evaluacion M1","guid":"UEJOjcj2QsyJLFNc5wZRmA","children":[{"id":"234","parent":"233","text":"Q1 Eje microbiota-intestino-cerebro produce serotonina + GABA + dopamina + SCFA -> modula cognicion via vago/HPA/inmune (no la inflamacion ni grasas saturadas)","guid":"75oDUyvEQ0Wt8DHOknF7-g","children":[]},{"id":"235","parent":"233","text":"Q4 CV envejecimiento PAS sube por rigidez arterial (mas colageno, menos elastina); FE conservada en reposo; distensibilidad y FC max DISMINUYEN","guid":"YefLRcXFTASDGtlorIu3KA","children":[]},{"id":"236","parent":"233","text":"Q12 Fase II (glucuronidacion) preservada con edad -> lorazepam (unica BZD fase II en Chile) = mas segura cuando indispensable; fase I (CYP450) cae","guid":"_Mr5xwuBRq20kQJ-btFQHQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"237","parent":"232","text":"Evaluacion Final (transversales)","guid":"tVJuwuO-RH6GJyvB2MEXZw","children":[{"id":"238","parent":"237","text":"Q3 examinado 2x M1+Final Lorazepam fase II preservada -> BZD mas segura en AM (memorizar)","guid":"SVm54JcAQj-inQMLmkvqKg","children":[]},{"id":"239","parent":"237","text":"Q4 Sarcopenia EWGSOP2 = masa + fuerza + funcion -> caidas + fracturas + hospitalizacion + mortalidad (fibras tipo II preferentemente)","guid":"13U9hxIFT3SRXwzgm5ZWag","children":[]},{"id":"240","parent":"237","text":"Q5 VFG cae ~8 mL/min/1,73m2 por decada -> riesgo toxicidad por farmacos eliminacion renal (ajustar dosis siempre)","guid":"UPGb9UznRl6bn6CRaRr2aQ","children":[]},{"id":"241","parent":"237","text":"Q15 HSA mecanismo rigidez arterial por reemplazo elastina por colageno -> aumenta velocidad onda pulso (mismo concepto que M3-Saez Q1)","guid":"zaAKYyRYQqGMKu42jIe0iw","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"242","parent":"0","text":"Preguntas Autoestudio (oficiales del docente)","guid":"WISPkUmgSp6LHVN3ukJePg","children":[{"id":"243","parent":"242","text":"Como distinguir clinicamente entre un cambio fisiologico propio del envejecimiento y una enfermedad (ejemplos CV, renal, cognitivo)","guid":"5e_4vjCuQZilpprB1i8mNw","children":[]},{"id":"244","parent":"242","text":"De que manera el aumento de la rigidez arterial y la menor distensibilidad cardiaca modifican la presentacion clinica de la enfermedad CV en el AM (HTA sistolica aislada, HFpEF, tolerancia ejercicio)","guid":"xaPqgF2aSO6GUv6HKqhF8g","children":[]},{"id":"245","parent":"242","text":"Como los cambios renales asociados a la edad influyen en prescripcion y seguridad de medicamentos en geriatria (VFG, adaptacion hidroelectrolitica, RAM)","guid":"dJFeVcQLTKKYnJUPpAhV_A","children":[]},{"id":"246","parent":"242","text":"Que relacion existe entre sarcopenia, fragilidad y riesgo de eventos adversos (caidas, hospitalizacion, mortalidad) y posibles intervenciones preventivas","guid":"NPJy5ragQKaxjBUOp-08_Q","children":[]},{"id":"247","parent":"242","text":"Como se modifican los procesos cognitivos normales con la edad y que implicancias tiene para evaluacion clinica del deterioro cognitivo (memoria episodica, trabajo, velocidad procesamiento vs neurodegenerativas)","guid":"Op10e1wWQfWJPMSUFWCTbA","children":[]},{"id":"248","parent":"242","text":"Como interactuan los cambios en composicion corporal (sarcopenia + grasa visceral) con el metabolismo de la glucosa en el AM (obesidad sarcopenica, DM, sindrome metabolico)","guid":"hPk7F7RLRc28Cpmug0cEfA","children":[]}]},{"id":"249","parent":"0","text":"Referencias (oficiales del curso)","guid":"lrKtB8oQQceMcRfiVCPjjg","children":[{"id":"250","parent":"249","text":"1. Salech F, Jara R, Michea L. Cambios fisiologicos asociados al envejecimiento. Rev Med Clin Condes 2012;23(1):19-29.","guid":"X-0Ze5dgSPy1oS2XbgtuCw","children":[]},{"id":"251","parent":"249","text":"2. Molnar AA, Nadasy GL, Dornyei G, et al. The aging venous system: from varicosities to vascular cognitive impairment. GeroScience 2021;43(6):2761-2784.","guid":"-5tTi7I2T3K9Utf3lzcNdg","children":[]},{"id":"252","parent":"249","text":"3. Lopez-Otin C, et al. Hallmarks of Aging. Cell 2013 (actualizacion 2023).","guid":"4Evc_UdwR9Kz4JYQpv2iEw","children":[]},{"id":"253","parent":"249","text":"4. Albala C. Estudio Alexandros INTA, U Chile.","guid":"pxOwiMibRdeEjT6Iavs7pQ","children":[]},{"id":"254","parent":"249","text":"5. Lakatta EG. Arterial and Cardiac Aging. Circulation 2003;107.","guid":"iDHXh3bZQGGJt4ZNUDRpEg","children":[]},{"id":"255","parent":"249","text":"6. Cruz-Jentoft AJ et al. EWGSOP2 Sarcopenia consensus. Age Ageing 2019;48(1):16-31.","guid":"Rk-lFutCTAu2Ihp7WSEVHA","children":[]},{"id":"256","parent":"249","text":"7. Perico N. Aging and the kidney. Curr Opin Nephrol Hypertens 2011;20(3):312-7.","guid":"L3S4FXuVT0i_LaS_HF9q4Q","children":[]},{"id":"257","parent":"249","text":"8. Burke SN. Neural plasticity in ageing brain. Nat Rev Neurosci 2006;7(1):30-40.","guid":"z-mu5jbGTziPMaBIk78YzA","children":[]}]}]},"node_count":257,"relations":[],"cross_references":[],"specialty":"Geriatría","folder":"Entidades clínicas/Geriatría","filename":"TIROTOXICOSIS EN ANCIANOS-2025","id":"map_159","resolved_references":[]}